Cell["Exercise 2", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"bad208c8-55c2-4634-b5e4-a346f53b16db"],

Cell["\<\
(a) Verify that node[i, n] are the roots of ChebyshevT[n, x] for n = 7 (use \
NSolve or evaluate ChebyshevT at the nodes). (b) Repeat the orthogonality \
check with equally spaced points instead of Chebyshev nodes. Is the matrix \
still diagonal?\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8f027b7b-24c3-467a-8451-49aa4560f059"],

