Cell["\<\
Both converge geometrically, until rounding error at ~1e-15. Runge's function \
converges more slowly because its poles at x = \[PlusMinus]i/5 are close to \
the interval (smaller \[Rho]). Now compare with the coefficients:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ec313a4a-17a8-4ff3-9720-86ea5e5de6e8"],

