Cell["\<\
(Each curve starts at its own ISCO; for r0 below it the map gives rC > 1 and \
the function returns unevaluated, so nothing is drawn.)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e5df6cb-6969-45a1-9fbe-5a93cc0c270c"]
}, Open  ]],

